<h1>Privacy</h1>

<p>RaceDay is a student project. We keep your privacy simple:</p>

<ul>
    <li>We store your name, email address and a hashed password (never the password itself).</li>
    <li>We store your event entries and race results.</li>
    <li>If you upload a profile picture or event banner, it is stored in Azure Blob Storage and can be viewed by anyone with its link.</li>
    <li>We use one session cookie to keep you logged in. We do not use tracking or advertising cookies.</li>
    <li>We do not sell or share your information.</li>
</ul>

<p>To have your details removed, contact us.</p>